"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"83915","synopsis":"流行り病に罹った秀吉の見舞いに来た千鳥と助蔵。そこへ、秀吉の友人であるねねが押し掛ける。ねねは秀吉を密かに慕っていたが、秀吉は信長の妹・お市に片思いしていた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v4BV6BdorjSQ5UG3nP89rDvwXqp.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"83914","synopsis":"今川義元が大軍を率いて尾張に侵攻をはじめる。慌てふためく織田勢であったが、なぜか信長は落ち着いていた。一方、千鳥は信長の命を受けて重要な任務についていた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h9kp8VOFnKmsRrjddsRri97an4P.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"83916","synopsis":"信長は『敦盛』を舞い出陣。しかし、二万五千の圧倒的兵力を誇る今川軍は次々と砦を陥落させ、織田軍は劣勢に立たされる。そんな中、信長は前線にて千鳥からの報告をひたすら待っていた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A35iv47MeFFYoLCfshSzdKAsmBn.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"83917","synopsis":"兵力差で圧倒的不利な信長は、今川義元がいる本隊だけを狙い進軍していた。そして、居場所を探らせていた千鳥からの報告を受け、桶狭間付近でついに義元の姿を視界にとらえる！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ndK7wVbf8YcFF5AVWRHFjHk4IL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"83918","synopsis":"歴史的大逆転で今川義元に勝利した信長の武名は、日本中に鳴り響く。そこにやってきた歴史書記愛好家の太田牛一は、勝利に一役かった千鳥の活躍を記録したいと云うが……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AqBLmIFneIFhmlGTVMVhYqzUam6.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"83919","synopsis":"三河国大名の松平元康は、長く臣従を強いられてきた今川家と決別。信長と同盟を結ぶために清洲城にやって来た。千鳥は元康に仕えている服部半蔵に興味津々！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1t29aTtBkgRIufPWXkbTYr8EVqA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"83920","synopsis":"信長は美濃に侵攻を開始。美濃国大名の斎藤龍興は、だらしのない男であったが、美濃三人衆と軍略の天才・竹中半兵衛の智謀で、信長は撤退をよぎなくされる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kttjIGXBRqq2HnqCcQOSnVdDUc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"83921","synopsis":"龍興の体たらくに、美濃三人衆の稲葉・氏家・安藤は嫌気がさしていた。千鳥は竹中半兵衛を暗殺するため美濃に潜入するも、美濃三人衆に忍びと見抜かれてしまう！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jRh1U0N1FiEfRjSA1X0ChXazS7M.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"83923","synopsis":"負傷した千鳥を家に運び手当てをしたのは、竹中半兵衛その人であった。命の恩人を暗殺するためクナイを手にする千鳥だったが、不覚にも半兵衛に情がうつってしまい……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wYOCRZs8PELZkjDEhNxX6oOzkck.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"83922","synopsis":"突然、稲葉山城を乗っ取ると言い出した半兵衛は、たった十六人の兵と千鳥を連れて正面から堂々と侵入。半兵衛の巧妙な作戦によって城内は混乱を極め、遂には龍興を追いつめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5g5zLeFv052X3ePALt567AKTaKU.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 14","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"83924","synopsis":"戦国一のおしどり夫婦、前田利家とまつ。二人を見たねねは、秀吉にも早く出世して欲しいと願う。一方、信長は美濃領内である墨俣への築城を計画していた。その任務に立候補したのは、なんと秀吉だった。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/owX5yQ9Qc5nBQmuU6ywWBJTh3g9.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"83925","synopsis":"秀吉は墨俣築城にあたり、野武士の頭領である蜂須賀小六に協力して欲しいと交渉する。しかし小六は簡単に首を縦に振らない。そこで秀吉は信長の大きな理想を語って説得を試みる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Iur6GPIPGdqn1nBJlzdy8fSEF3.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 16","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"83927","synopsis":"難航が見込まれた築城を順調にこなす秀吉たち。その矢先、そうはさせじと斎藤軍が来襲する。三日間不眠不休で築城した秀吉たちは負けじと応戦するが、絶体絶命の状況に！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hMsVcJN6NzBgMcH2UDT5DbhyZ14.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 17","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"83926","synopsis":"美濃三人衆を味方に付けた信長は稲葉山城に攻め寄せる。織田軍に城内侵入を許してしまった龍興は錯乱し、いつも侍らせていた女性達を探しだす始末だった。ところが、そこに現れた女性は……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1L96KV0ML48Jm339FxOgfPLf3wf.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 18","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"83928","synopsis":"美濃で岐阜城と一大城下町の建設が進む一方、日本(ひのもと)の中枢「京」を目指す信長は秀吉と千鳥を呼び出す。そして、近江領内に隠棲している竹中半兵衛を仲間に引き入れるよう命じる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nUbPSxFYoofkAQPYf3aMK6OGdrk.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 19","episodeNumber":19,"sourceEpisodeNumber":19,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"83929","synopsis":"秀吉と千鳥は織田家へ仕えて欲しいと竹中半兵衛に頼むも、参謀を傍に置かない信長の元では役に立てないと断られてしまう。しかし、秀吉の語る夢と千鳥の説得によって半兵衛の気持ちが揺らぎ……。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/szfXu77Y0oK3xNyjE4NrEE3pRMA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":20,"sourceEpisodeNumber":20,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"83930","synopsis":"秀吉の参謀となった半兵衛は、織田家が上洛するためには近江国に道を確保する 必要があると言う。信長は婚姻同盟を結ぶために北近江の大名である浅井長政の元へお市を嫁がせることに決める。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5mCX1qwfkbJocTp6iCtZaEKQA4q.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 21","episodeNumber":21,"sourceEpisodeNumber":21,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"83931","synopsis":"将軍になりたい前将軍の弟・足利義昭は、匿ってもらっている朝倉家から飛び出して信長の元へ行くと言う。そこで、朝倉家に仕える新参者が織田家へと出向くことに。だが、この男はとある計画を考えていた。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g3UDOCOn24jGhIvUD9a26ESYhJ7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 22","episodeNumber":22,"sourceEpisodeNumber":22,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"83932","synopsis":"突然、稲葉山城を乗っ取ると言い出した半兵衛は、たった十六人の兵と千鳥を連れて正面から堂々と侵入。半兵衛の巧妙な作戦によって城内は混乱を極め、遂には龍興を追いつめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oqagS3BXrrSykpTvUo3zGHksv3E.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 23","episodeNumber":23,"sourceEpisodeNumber":23,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]}],"link":"83933","synopsis":"信長の上洛軍が京に入るにあたり、近江国を通過すると知った浅井家の反織田派・遠藤直経は、迎えるフリをして密かに暗殺を企てていた。そうと知らずに、信長たちは近江国の佐和山城へとやって来る。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cOeRJj61Z5ahAnRwnQox7z9rnA7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 24","episodeNumber":24,"sourceEpisodeNumber":24,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]}],"link":"83934","synopsis":"京を目指す信長は、南近江の六角承禎に何度も使者を送るが服従も協力も拒まれる。是非も無しと、六角打倒のため総勢六万の大軍をもって出陣。しかし、六角家には甲賀忍軍『甲賀五十三家』がいた！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yIRG6giv38XdCEv6kyK3LlkigK2.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 25","episodeNumber":25,"sourceEpisodeNumber":25,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[25]}],"link":"83935","synopsis":"六角承禎攻略のために、箕作城を急襲する秀吉・佐久間・丹羽。最前線の和田山城に攻め入ると思っていた六角の隙をついた作戦だが、箕作城も必死に抵抗する。そこで竹中半兵衛が新たな策略を立てる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4AgE1h5RN9mkxgPOXqhhQJCNuSt.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 26","episodeNumber":26,"sourceEpisodeNumber":26,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[26]}],"link":"83936","synopsis":"ついに京へ入った信長は、三好三人衆の掃討を柴田勝家と森可成らに指示し一掃する。天下取りがいよいよ現実的となった今、千鳥は他国から流れてきた自分が信長の側にいてもいいのかとひとり悩む。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2h8CEVxKkXQUTioYPXuo7tLENg1.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":21666,"malId":32829},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:21666","mal:32829"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11951","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-26":"1-26"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21666","ranges":{"1-26":"1-26"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"32829","ranges":{"1-26":"1-26"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68146","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-26":"1-26"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"315092","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-26":"1-26"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":5517,"title":"Nobunaga no Shinobi","title_eng":"Ninja Girl & Samurai Master","slug":"ninja-girl-samurai-master","plot":"Anno 1555, periodo degli Stati in Guerra, un giovane ha un grande sogno. Quest'uomo, considerato una testa vuota, non è altri che Oda Nobunaga. Incantata dal suo sogno, una ragazza che ammira Nobunaga giura di diventare un giorno il suo ninja. Nobunaga ha uno scopo: unificare il Giappone con la forza del suo esercito! Con un cast di persoanggi variopinto, tra cui la zuccona Kichou, il fattorino Hideyoshi, la tsundere Nene, il diretto Mitsuhide e il mezzo morto Hanbei, la serie anime comic